# Quark Patch English Localization
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_stoneling_vanish=Stoneling Dust Vanish
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_stoneling_vanish=Disperse cloud of stone dust, gaining Invisibility and Speed II for 6s while leaving debris behind!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_stoneling_toss=Stoneling Pebble Toss
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_stoneling_toss=Hurl an ore pebble towards crosshair, dealing 5 physical damage and knockback!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_stoneling_burrow=Stoneling Earth Burrow
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_stoneling_burrow=Sink into the earth like a buried boulder for 5s, gaining Resistance II and slow earthen regeneration while rooted in place! (20s cooldown)
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_stoneling_ore_magnet=Stoneling Ore Magnet
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_stoneling_ore_magnet=Channel the diamond-loving packrat's hauling instinct: pull all dropped items within 12 blocks to your feet and gain Haste I for 10s! (10s cooldown)
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_frog_leap=Frog Leap
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_frog_leap=Charge and leap 4 blocks high and forward with ribbit sound and splash particles, immune to fall damage!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_frog_tongue=Sticky Tongue Pull
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_frog_tongue=Extend sticky tongue up to 8 blocks, pulling target or items to your feet and applying Slowness III!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_frog_wednesday=Wednesday Frog Croak
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_frog_wednesday=Croak the legendary Wednesday song (Quark's frog croak), spawning 1-2 phantom frogs that hop away while briefly drawing nearby hostile attention! The chorus is bigger on Wednesday!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_crab_pincer_snip=Crab Pincer Snip
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_crab_pincer_snip=Snap massive iron pincers, dealing 9 armor-piercing damage and disabling shields! Can shear sheep without harm!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_crab_sidestep=Crab Sidestep
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_crab_sidestep=Sidestep rapidly 5 blocks to dodge incoming attacks and projectiles!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_crab_shell_shield=Crab Shell Shield
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_crab_shell_shield=Retract into impenetrable chitin carapace, gaining Resistance III and Absorption for 5s while knocking back melee attackers!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_crab_rave=Crab Rave
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_crab_rave=Start a 6-second crab rave with jukebox note particles and dance beats, gaining Speed II while nearby allies party on with Resistance I!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_wraith_shriek=Wraith Soul Shriek
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_wraith_shriek=Emit a terrifying screech, inflicting Weakness II and Slowness II for 6s in a 12-block radius!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_wraith_phase=Wraith Shadow Phase
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_wraith_phase=Phase through entities for 10 blocks as ethereal smoke, dealing 6 wither damage and draining 4 health!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_wraith_soul_grasp=Wraith Soul Grasp
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_wraith_soul_grasp=Reach out a ghostly hand to seize the first enemy within 10 blocks, dealing 4 damage, 3s Slowness II and dragging them toward you! (14s cooldown)
morphext.ability.quark_wraith_light_fear.name=Wraith Light Fear
morphext.ability.quark_wraith_light_fear.desc=Wraith Light Fear: Bright light (level >= 12) or direct sunlight inflicts Weakness I and Slowness I. In darkness (level <= 7), gain Night Vision and Speed I.
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_wraith_light_fear=Wraith Light Fear: Bright light inflicts Weakness and Slowness; darkness grants Night Vision and Speed.
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_foxhound_fire_breath=Foxhound Fire Breath
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_foxhound_fire_breath=Breathe torrent of nether flame, igniting enemies in front and inflicting burning for 8s!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_foxhound_flame_pounce=Foxhound Flame Pounce
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_foxhound_flame_pounce=Lunge forward wrapped in infernal fire, biting targets for 8 fire damage while erupting a flame shield ring around yourself!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_foxhound_love_burn=Foxhound Burning Love
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_foxhound_love_burn=The fiery hound's affection blazes: a burst of flames and hearts grants Strength II and Speed II for 6s while allies within 6 blocks gain Fire Resistance for 8s! (18s cooldown)
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_foxhound_smelt_touch=Foxhound Smelting Touch
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_foxhound_smelt_touch=Channel the hearth-dwelling hound's smelting aura to instantly smelt up to 8 furnace-recipe items in your inventory (ores to ingots, sand to glass)! (10s cooldown)
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_ashen_blind_shot=Ashen Blind Shot
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_ashen_blind_shot=Shoot burning ashen arrow, triggering 4-block black smoke cloud that blinds targets for 6s!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_ashen_ash_veil=Ashen Ash Veil
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_ashen_ash_veil=Burst a 4-block choking ash cloud, blinding enemies for 3s and marking them with Glowing for 5s; the veil never hinders yourself!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_dweller_pierce_shot=Dweller Deep Piercing Arrow
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_dweller_pierce_shot=Shoot a heavy piercing arrow, applying Hunger II and Mining Fatigue II for 8s! (Playful non-canon skill)
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_dweller_lurk=Dweller Lurk
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_dweller_lurk=Sink into subterranean stealth with 8s Invisibility; the first melee after breaking stealth (within 2s) deals +4 bonus damage and 3s Slowness!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_dweller_ambush_mark=Ambush Mark
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_dweller_ambush_mark=Growl a predatory mark over enemies within 10 blocks, applying Glowing and Slowness I for 5s; at night or in darkness you blend into the shadows with 4s Invisibility!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_pirate_flourish=Rapier Flourish
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_pirate_flourish=Lunge forward and thrust rapier for 8 critical damage, parrying attacks during the dash!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_pirate_captain=Captain's Command
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_pirate_captain=Blow the captain's call: nearby undead crew and allies gain Strength I and Speed I for 8s, you gain Resistance I, and non-undead enemies falter with Weakness!
morphext.metamorph.action.quark_archaeologist_appraise=Archaeologist Appraisal
morphext.metamorph.desc.quark_archaeologist_appraise=Trade 1 emerald for an expert appraisal, yielding 2-4 random ore or treasure finds with trading jingles and sparkles! (60s cooldown)
morphext.variant.pirate_captain=(Captain)
morph.category.quark=Quark
morphext.faction.underworld.desc=Includes stonelings, dwellers and wraiths inhabiting the deep caves.
